__d(function(e,t,o,a,n,i,s){n.exports={path:"/what-is-go-do",title:"What is Go Do? The Free App for Finding Things to Do in Utah",description:"Go Do is a free app and website that puts every concert, game, festival, class, event and outdoor activity in Utah in one place, soonest first, and makes it easy to make plans with friends and actually get out and do things.",kicker:"About Go Do",h1:"What is Go Do?",lead:"Go Do is a free app and website that finds everything there is to do in Utah \u2014 concerts, games, festivals, shows, classes, community events and outdoor adventures \u2014 and puts it all in one feed, soonest first. Then it makes it easy to make plans with your friends and actually go.",sections:[{id:"how-it-started",heading:"How it all started",paragraphs:["Go Do started with date night. Every week our founder sat down to plan something fun to do with his wife, and every week it turned into the same thing: hours and hours of searching the web. One site for concerts, another for theater, a city calendar here, a ticket site there, a Facebook event someone mentioned, a festival he heard about too late.","The information was all out there \u2014 it was just scattered across dozens of websites, and none of them showed everything happening in one place. By the time he had pieced together a plan, the evening was half gone, and the best events were often ones he only found out about after they were over.","So he set out to build the thing he wished existed: one place that gathers every event and activity in Utah automatically, sorts it by what's happening soonest, and makes it simple to pick something and go. That idea became Go Do."]},{id:"our-premise",heading:"Our premise: get out and live life",paragraphs:["Go Do exists to get people out of the house and doing things in real life. Too many evenings and weekends disappear into sitting at home, being bored, and doom scrolling \u2014 living in a virtual world instead of the real one right outside the door.","Utah is full of amazing things to do: live music, pro and college sports, theater, festivals, farmers markets, art walks, trails, lakes, slopes and national parks. The hard part has never been a lack of things to do. It's knowing what's happening, and getting your people together to go.","That's what Go Do is for. We use technology to help you find amazing things to do around you, make the plan with your friends, and then get out and make actual memories together. Our tagline says it all: Go Do. Live Life."]},{id:"what-you-can-do",heading:"What you can do with Go Do",features:[{icon:"list-outline",title:"See everything in one feed",body:"Every event and activity we can find in Utah, gathered automatically from venue, city, school, library and team calendars and the major ticket sellers \u2014 sorted with what's happening soonest at the top."},{icon:"options-outline",title:"Find exactly what you want",body:"Search and filter by category, date, price, distance and age. Free events, kid-friendly activities, 21+ nightlife, this weekend near you \u2014 it's all a tap away."},{icon:"people-outline",title:"Make plans with friends",body:"Tap Go Do to make a plan: ping friends (\u201cShould we go?\u201d), or invite friends and groups to a day \u2014 or a few days to pick from \u2014 and see what your friends are going to. Plans show up on everyone\u2019s Plans so nobody forgets."},{icon:"calendar-outline",title:"Plan your own get-togethers",body:"Sunday dinner, game night, lunch with friends: plan it once, or have it repeat every week, 2 weeks, month or 3 months. Friends can say they\u2019re in for all of them."},{icon:"heart-outline",title:"Follow what you love",body:"Tap \u2665 to follow an event or activity, everything at a venue, or your team\u2019s games. They collect in your Following tab. Go Do lets you know about new ones, and reminds you the day before an event you \u2665."},{icon:"chatbubbles-outline",title:"Chat and share",body:"Message friends and groups, start a chat for a plan, add people to a chat, share events and photos, post from what you did, tag friends and react to messages."},{icon:"restaurant-outline",title:"Plan the whole night",body:"From any event, find restaurants nearby, get a ride, look for places to stay, and get directions \u2014 so date night or a weekend trip comes together fast."},{icon:"star-outline",title:"Know before you go",body:"Read reviews and see photos from people who've been, check who else is going, and add it to your plans in one tap."},{icon:"sparkles-outline",title:"Picks that get better",body:"Tell Get better picks where you are, who you go with and what looks fun. \ud83d\udc4d and \ud83d\udc4e teach your Suggested feed what you like."}]},{id:"things-to-do-in-utah",heading:"Things to do in Utah \u2014 every kind",paragraphs:["Go Do covers the full range of things to do in Utah, for every age and every budget:"],bullets:["Concerts and live music \u2014 from big arena shows to local bands and open mics","Sports \u2014 pro, college and high school games, races, tournaments and rec leagues","Theater, dance, comedy and the performing arts","Festivals, fairs, parades, holiday celebrations and cultural events","Family and kids' activities \u2014 story times, museums, zoos, camps and classes","Outdoor adventures \u2014 hiking, biking, climbing, paddling, skiing, golf and parks","Food and drink \u2014 farmers markets, food trucks, tastings and restaurant events","Arts and culture \u2014 galleries, art walks, museums, film and lectures","Classes and workshops \u2014 cooking, art, fitness, dance and more","Community events \u2014 library programs, city events, volunteer days and meetups","Nightlife \u2014 music, dancing, trivia and 21+ events","Free things to do \u2014 hundreds of free events and activities every week"]},{id:"all-of-utah",heading:"All of Utah, in one place",paragraphs:["Go Do covers the whole state \u2014 every county, from Logan to St. George. That includes Salt Lake City, Provo, Orem, Ogden, West Valley City, Sandy, West Jordan, South Jordan, Lehi, Draper, American Fork, Layton, Bountiful, Murray, Herriman, Park City, Heber, Logan, Cedar City, St. George, Moab and everywhere in between.","Set your home area and Go Do shows what's close to you first, or search anywhere in Utah when you're planning a trip."]},{id:"who-its-for",heading:"Who Go Do is for",features:[{icon:"heart-outline",title:"Couples",body:"Date night ideas every week, without the hours of searching."},{icon:"home-outline",title:"Families",body:"Kid-friendly and free things to do this weekend, filtered by age."},{icon:"happy-outline",title:"Friends",body:"Get the group chat off the couch and into a plan everyone can see."},{icon:"map-outline",title:"New to Utah",body:"Discover what your new home has to offer and meet people doing the same."},{icon:"school-outline",title:"Students",body:"Campus events, cheap nights out and weekend adventures."},{icon:"trail-sign-outline",title:"Adventurers",body:"Trails, lakes, slopes and parks alongside the events calendar."}]},{id:"faq",heading:"Common questions",faq:[["Is Go Do free?","Yes. Go Do is completely free for everyone who uses it to find things to do and make plans."],["Where does Go Do get its events?","Go Do automatically reads public calendars from venues, cities, counties, schools, libraries and teams across Utah, plus the major ticket sellers, and partners can send their events to us directly. Members can add events too."],["Is there a Go Do app for iPhone and Android?","Go Do works on any phone today. It isn't in the App Store or Google Play yet, but you can add it to your Home Screen in a few seconds and it works just like an app. See [How to Install](/how-to-install)."],["What parts of Utah does Go Do cover?","All of Utah \u2014 every county, from Logan to St. George, including Salt Lake City, Utah County, Ogden, Park City, Moab and southern Utah."],["Can I add my own event?","Yes. Members can add public events and activities for everyone, or friends-only events. Organizations can become partners and send their events automatically, or add them in the Partner portal. See [Data Feed](/data-feed)."],["Can I use Go Do with ChatGPT or Claude?","Yes. Connect Claude, ChatGPT, Grok, Perplexity or another AI assistant to your Go Do account and ask what\u2019s happening, check your plans and invites, or have it make plans with friends when you ask. See [AI Agents](/ai-agents)."],["Who can advertise on Go Do?","Local businesses, venues and event organizers can sign up as advertisers and run clearly labeled sponsored cards and sponsor their events through the Go Do Advertiser portal."]]}],cta:{heading:"Ready to get out and do something?",body:"Create your free account and see everything happening near you this week.",actions:[{label:"Create a free account",href:"/welcome",primary:!0},{label:"How to install",href:"/how-to-install"}]}}},1014,[]);